{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37398","headline":"叙别 · 唐彦谦","name":"叙别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谯楼夜促莲花漏，树阴摇月蛟螭走。\n蟠拏对月吸深杯，月府清虚玉兔吼。\n翠盘擘脯臙脂香，碧碗敲冰分蔗浆。\n十载番思旧时事，好怀不似当年狂。\n夜合花香开小院，坐爱凉风吹醉面。\n酒中弹剑发清歌，白发年来爲愁变。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}